222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Takhaial.com, a distinguished brand within the software development sector, specializes in the cutting-edge realms of Augmented Reality \(AR\) and Virtual Reality \(VR\). Headquartered in Kuwait, our brand represents the pinnacle of innovation and expertise in the Middle East and North Africa, dedicated to revolutionizing business-to-business \(B2B\) interactions through immersive technology solutions. Formerly known as General Senses, Takhaial.com is on a mission to transform human decision-making processes by merging logic with emotion in unparalleled immersive experiences.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
223 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our recognition as the Kuwait Startup of the Year in 2017 by SeedStars underscores our commitment to excellence and our pioneering role in the AR and VR industry. This accolade affirms our dedication to exploring and expanding the frontiers of digital reality through state-of-the-art technologies. Furthermore, our acquisition of the Apple Vision Pro Development Kit places us at the forefront of innovation, enabling us to deliver advanced and impactful AR and VR applications tailored to the specific needs of our business clients.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Takhaial.com is more than just a company; it is a brand synonymous with pushing the boundaries of digital interaction and engagement. Our headquarters in Kuwait serves as the hub of our operations, from where we spearhead initiatives to enhance and transform the way businesses connect with their audiences across the globe. Our focus on AR and VR technologies positions us as key players in the digital transformation era, dedicated to setting new benchmarks in immersive technology solutions for the B2B sector.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
