<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Experiencing the immersive world of Augmented Reality \(AR\) and Virtual Reality \(VR\) is truly beyond what words can describe. To bridge the gap between explanation and experience, we've implemented a simple yet powerful solution: a QR code demo.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
317 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (By scanning the QR code with your smart device, you will instantly deploy an AR demonstration that leaps off the screen and into your environment. This interactive preview showcases the seamless integration of digital information with the real world, a core aspect of what AR is all about.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Moreover, this QR code can be placed across various media types, offering a versatile and accessible way to engage with our technology. Whether it's printed on a brochure, displayed on a digital billboard, or integrated into an online platform, the QR code remains a convenient portal to a vivid AR demonstration, inviting users to experience the future of technology firsthand.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
